    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14625#discussion_r4317160074\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm still concerned about this growing without a bound. If that's not an issue, could you add a comment explaining why?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 633092363,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792433777
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> rvolosatovs submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14625#pullrequestreview-5575697502\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks for the updates!</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"https://github.com/rvolosatovs/wasmtime/commit/fb49791fdae96cbc59c45e092f3d32417877e355\">https://github.com/rvolosatovs/wasmtime/commit/fb49791fdae96cbc59c45e092f3d32417877e355</a></p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">http</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">handler</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>p3_caller_drop_keeps_request_expiration</code> fails on this PR, but passes on <code>main</code></p>\n<p>This means that once a caller drops, its request's expiration is dropped too: the instance keeps accepting new requests even after <code>request_timeout</code> has passed, and the orphaned guest tasks accumulate indefinitely.</p>\n<p>Could you take a look?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 633092370,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792433778
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14625#issuecomment-6289264155\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14625\">PR #14625</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm closing this PR. <br>\nI also suggest removing the TODO: it conflicts with the new tests,expiring on caller drop is the opposite of leaving the worker accepting.<br>\n@rvolosatovs </p>\n</blockquote>",
